-- valid
ok Ann 2
-- valid, no ref
ok Ann 1
-- many
name: must have at least 2 characters
email: must be an email address
priority: must be one of "low", "medium", "high"
delta: must be at most 5
delta: must be even
scores[1]: must be at least 0
scores[2]: must be at least 0
ref_id: must be a UUID
ratio: must be at least 1
-- lines
lines[0].sku: must have at least 2 characters
lines[0].qty: must be at least 1
lines[0].price_cents: must be at least 0
lines[2].qty: must be at most 99
-- too few lines
lines: must have at least 1 item
-- long name
name: must have at most 5 characters
-- misuse
mail: unknown format `emial` (the formats: email, uuid, uri, date, date-time, ipv4, hostname)
word: @[check(min)] does not apply to this type
n: @[check(format)] does not apply to this type
